{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1879018,
  "courseSlug": "nodejs-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "NodeJS - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "20342165",
      "title": "Moving to a Better Project Structure",
      "lectureOrder": 512,
      "videoOrder": 454,
      "sourceHash": "34e52c7e18edfce4ee3ed1b45b4bd7f24a9c84336ee95f696bc73dc968d22b7a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.23,
          "end": 4.61,
          "en": "With that, we're finished with the code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.61,
          "end": 8.92,
          "en": "But I'm not 100% happy about the folder structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.92,
          "end": 11.25,
          "en": "For one, I only have a routes folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.25,
          "end": 14.2,
          "en": "I don't have a controllers folder, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.2,
          "end": 16.05,
          "en": "Now, obviously, you can split it up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.05,
          "end": 18.39,
          "en": "You can add a controllers folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.39,
          "end": 21.81,
          "en": "and put those controller functions here into that folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.81,
          "end": 24.8,
          "en": "just as we did it in other parts of the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.8,
          "end": 26.95,
          "en": "I just kept it all in one file here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.95,
          "end": 29.83,
          "en": "because it's really just a basic dummy API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.83,
          "end": 31.66,
          "en": "with very little code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.66,
          "end": 33.7,
          "en": "So, I think using one file is fine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.7,
          "end": 36.26,
          "en": "but you can absolutely use a controllers folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.26,
          "end": 38.57,
          "en": "with a controller file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.57,
          "end": 39.9,
          "en": "The more important thing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.9,
          "end": 41.88,
          "en": "or the more annoying thing for me here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.88,
          "end": 44.51,
          "en": "is that we always have these JavaScript files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.51,
          "end": 46.49,
          "en": "next to the TypeScript files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.49,
          "end": 50.5,
          "en": "And the problem with that is that our actual source code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.5,
          "end": 55.18,
          "en": "in which we as developer work is just the TypeScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.18,
          "end": 57.85,
          "en": "So therefore, we have the extra files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.85,
          "end": 59.77,
          "en": "next to our source code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.77,
          "end": 62.84,
          "en": "and we shouldn't work in those extra JavaScript files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.84,
          "end": 64.81,
          "en": "You shouldn't change that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.81,
          "end": 67.72,
          "en": "You should only work in the TypeScript files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.72,
          "end": 72.18,
          "en": "And therefore, I wanna ensure that the compiled files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.18,
          "end": 74.483,
          "en": "end up in a different place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.62,
          "end": 79.56,
          "en": "And to achieve this, we can go to the tsconfig.json file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.56,
          "end": 82.68,
          "en": "and there, we have the outDir configuration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.68,
          "end": 84.86,
          "en": "which I'll now comment in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.86,
          "end": 87.03,
          "en": "This allows you to set a directory",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.03,
          "end": 90.74,
          "en": "where the generated JavaScript files will be stored in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.74,
          "end": 94.69,
          "en": "And here, I will specify /dist as a directory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.69,
          "end": 97.43,
          "en": "This will create a new dist sub-folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.43,
          "end": 102.05,
          "en": "and all of our compiled files will end up in that folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.05,
          "end": 105.093,
          "en": "With that change made, if I now run tsc,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.41,
          "end": 108.237,
          "en": "you see that we get this dist folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.237,
          "end": 110.75999999999999,
          "en": "and in dir, we got the same folder structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.75999999999999,
          "end": 112.28999999999999,
          "en": "as outside of it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.28999999999999,
          "end": 115.56,
          "en": "but now in dir, we only got our JavaScript files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.56,
          "end": 118.37,
          "en": "And if I now delete the other JavaScript files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.37,
          "end": 119.97999999999999,
          "en": "outside of the dist folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.38,
          "end": 124.06,
          "en": "to only have my TypeScript source code there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.06,
          "end": 128.07,
          "en": "if I rerun tsc, you see they're not appearing again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.07,
          "end": 130.52,
          "en": "They're really only in the dist folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.52,
          "end": 131.42,
          "en": "So, that's great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.42,
          "end": 135.34,
          "en": "Now, the dist folder holds our finished Node app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.34,
          "end": 138.07999999999998,
          "en": "which we can run with the Node executable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.07999999999998,
          "end": 141.53,
          "en": "And our source code is outside of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.53,
          "end": 144.31,
          "en": "Maybe you also want a separate source folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.31,
          "end": 146.72,
          "en": "in which you store your source code though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.72,
          "end": 150.22,
          "en": "to have a clear separation of input and output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 150.22,
          "end": 151.56,
          "en": "And that's something I'll do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 151.56,
          "end": 155.01,
          "en": "For that I'll add a source, a src folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 155.01,
          "end": 158.39,
          "en": "and move my models folder, my routes folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.39,
          "end": 162.9,
          "en": "and the app.ts file into that source folder here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.9,
          "end": 163.963,
          "en": "just like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.21,
          "end": 169.54,
          "en": "I'll keep the rest of the project structure as it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 169.54,
          "end": 173.13,
          "en": "And now in tsconfig.json, we can set up our rootDir",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.13,
          "end": 177.37,
          "en": "which specifies the root directory of input files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.37,
          "end": 182,
          "en": "And I wanna set that to /src to make it clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 182,
          "end": 185.6,
          "en": "that that's the folder that contains our TypeScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.6,
          "end": 188.4,
          "en": "And then the outDir is the folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.4,
          "end": 191.63,
          "en": "where the compiled code should end up in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.63,
          "end": 194.9,
          "en": "So, now if I run tsc, that still works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 194.9,
          "end": 196.36,
          "en": "and it's now taking the source code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 196.36,
          "end": 200.27,
          "en": "from inside the source folder to generate the dist folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 200.27,
          "end": 204.71,
          "en": "And if I delete dist, that folder is of course regenerated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 204.71,
          "end": 207.29,
          "en": "which proves that everything works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 207.29,
          "end": 208.42000000000002,
          "en": "Now important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.42000000000002,
          "end": 211.3,
          "en": "we're always executing the code into dist folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.3,
          "end": 213.77,
          "en": "because Node.js is not capable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.77,
          "end": 216.24,
          "en": "of running TypeScript code like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.24,
          "end": 218.66,
          "en": "We only work in the source folder though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.66,
          "end": 220.96,
          "en": "and then we compile it to JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 220.96,
          "end": 222.69299999999998,
          "en": "to have our executable code.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
